 318:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * U54s startup.
 319:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * This is called from entry.S
 320:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * If you need to modify this function, create your own one in a user directory
 321:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * space.
 322:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  *
 323:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * Please note: harts MPFS_HAL_FIRST_FIRST + 1 to MPFS_HAL_FIRST_LAST will wait
 324:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * in startup code in entry.S as they run the wfi (wait for interrupt)
 325:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * instruction.
 326:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * They are woken up as required by the the MPFS_HAL_FIRST_HART, in the function
 327:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * main_first_hart().
 328:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  * ( It triggers a software interrupt on the particular hart to be woken up )
 329:../src/platform/mpfs_hal/startup_gcc/system_startup.c ****  */
